    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-116 | TRAFICOM p.56 | 6.6.5.2</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>For impacts on non-hemispherical areas, such as the impact on the nozzle, the equivalent impact sphere radius must be estimated using the equation below.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
