    <nltl:sourceReference>I2-022 | IACS_UR_I2 p.8 | I2.4.2; I2-023 | IACS_UR_I2 p.9 | I2.4.2; I2-032 | IACS_UR_I2 p.12 | I2.6.2; I2-035 | IACS_UR_I2 p.13 | I2.7.2; I2-040 | IACS_UR_I2 p.14 | I2.9.1; I2-041 | IACS_UR_I2 p.15 | I2.9.3; I2-043 | IACS_UR_I2 p.15 | I2.9.4; I2-064 | IACS_UR_I2 p.21 | I2.17.5; TRF-041 | TRAFICOM p.17 | 4.3.2; TRF-042 | TRAFICOM p.17 | 4.3.2; TRF-044 | TRAFICOM p.18-19 | 4.4.2.1; TRF-048 | TRAFICOM p.20 | 4.4.3; TRF-051 | TRAFICOM p.21 | 4.4.4.2; TRF-053 | TRAFICOM p.21-22 | 4.5.1; TRF-054 | TRAFICOM p.22-23 | 4.5.2; TRF-059 | TRAFICOM p.23 | 4.6.2; TRF-060 | TRAFICOM p.24 | 4.6.2; TRF-068 | TRAFICOM p.26 | 5; TRF-123 | TRAFICOM p.61 | 6.7.3</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>For transverse framing, the thickness of the shell plating shall be determined by t = 667*s*sqrt(f_1*p_pl/sigma_y) + t_c [mm] (4.5). For longitudinal framing, the thickness shall be determined by t = 667*s*sqrt(p/(f_2*sigma_y)) + t_c [mm] (4.6).</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
