    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-068 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.24 | 8.3.2.1</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Ships shall have means to ensure safe evacuation of persons, including safe deployment of survival equipment, when operating in ice-covered waters, or directly onto the ice, as applicable.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
