    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>...ons shall also be checked, especially the locations centred at the mid-span or -spacing. Furthermore, if the load length la cannot be determined directly from the arrangement of the structure, several values of la shall be checked using corresponding values for ca.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
