  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceLoadCycleCount">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#benchmarkEntity"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Ice load cycle count</rdfs:label>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Ice load cycle count</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0362</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:stage1LocalName>iceLoadCycleCount</nltl:stage1LocalName>
    <nltl:module rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#moduleMachinery"/>
    <nltl:roleDecisionBasis>Stage 1 explicit integer</nltl:roleDecisionBasis>
    <nltl:namingBasis>Locked-workbook normalized regulatory term</nltl:namingBasis>
    <nltl:namingRule>N4 - preserve the source concept; normalize spelling to ASCII lowerCamelCase</nltl:namingRule>
    <nltl:unitDecisionStatus>Not a quantity property</nltl:unitDecisionStatus>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for iceLoadCycleCount derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-077 | TRAFICOM p.36 | 6.5.1.8; TRF-078 | TRAFICOM p.36 | 6.5.1.9; TRF-080 | TRAFICOM p.37 | 6.5.1.9; TRF-109 | TRAFICOM p.50 | 6.6.2.3</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>where k is the shape parameter of the spectrum, Nice is the number of load cycles in the spectrum, and Fice is the random variable for ice loads on the blade, 0 &lt;= Fice &lt;= (Fice)max. The shape parameter k=0.75 shall be used for the ice force distribution of an open propeller and the shape parameter k=1.0 for that of a ducted propeller blade.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
