    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>For category A and B ships constructed on or after 1 January 2017, the carriage of NLS identified in chapter 17, column e, as ship type 3 or identified as NLS in chapter 18 of the International Code for the Construction and Equipment of Ships Carrying Dangerous Chemicals in Bulk, in cargo tanks of type 3 ships shall be subject to the approval of the Administ...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
