    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-064 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.23 | 8.2.3.1</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Adequate thermal protection shall be provided for all persons on board, taking into account the intended voyage, the anticipated weather conditions (cold and wind) and the potential for immersion in polar water, where applicable.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
