    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>At every blade location, the equivalent fatigue stress shall satisfy sigma_fl/sigma_fat &gt;= 1.5 (6.45). Use sigma_fl = gamma_e1*gamma_e2*gamma_v*gamma_m*sigma_exp. If actual reduction factors are unavailable, use gamma_e1*gamma_e2 = 0.67, gamma_v = 0.75 and gamma_m = 0.75. Blade bolts, CP mechanism, propeller boss and propeller-shaft fitting shall have safety...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
