    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-037 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.19 | 4.3.2.1</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Ships of categories A and B, constructed on or after 1 January 2017, shall be able to withstand flooding resulting from hull penetration due to ice impact. The residual stability following ice damage shall be such that the factor s_i, as defined in SOLAS regulations II-1/7-2.2 and II-1/7-2.3, is equal to one for all loading conditions used to calculate the a...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
