    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for iceLoadCycleCoefficientK1 derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-078 | TRAFICOM p.36 | 6.5.1.9</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The number of load cycles per propeller blade in the load spectrum shall be N_ice = k_1*k_2*k_3*N_class*n_n (6.14), where N_class is given in Table 6-6 and the propeller location factor k_1 is given in Table 6-7.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
