    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-060 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.22 | 7.3.2.4</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Where fixed water-based firefighting systems are located in a space separate from the main fire pumps and use their own independent sea suction, this sea suction shall also be capable of being cleared of ice accumulation.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <skos:altLabel>independent_sea_suction_used</skos:altLabel>
