    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Materials of exposed structures in ships shall be approved by the Administration, or a recognized organization accepted by it, taking into account standards acceptable to the Organization or other standards offering an equivalent level of safety based on the polar service temperature.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
