    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for bladeTipOffset derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-101 | TRAFICOM p.45-46 | 6.5.4.1</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The ultimate load resulting from blade failure by plastic bending around the blade root shall be calculated using F_ex = 300*c*t^2*sigma_ref1/(0.8*D - 2*r) [kN] (6.35), or by an appropriate stress analysis reflecting the non-linear plastic material behaviour of the actual blade. The load is assumed to act at radius 0.8R in the weakest blade direction. A blad...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
