    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-084 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.27 | 9.3.2.1.4.1; IMO26-010 | IMO_AMEND_2026 p.3 | 9-1.3.2.1.4.1</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Where equipment required by SOLAS chapter V or this chapter has sensors that project below the hull, such sensors shall be protected against ice.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
