    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-051 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.22 | 7.2.1.2; IMO-055 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.22 | 7.3.1.1</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Local equipment and machinery controls shall be arranged so as to avoid freezing, snow accumulation and ice accretion and their location to remain accessible at all time.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
