    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for propellerPitchAtMcrFreeRunning derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-084 | TRAFICOM p.38 | 6.5.3.1; TRF-086 | TRAFICOM p.39 | 6.5.3.2</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>For CP propellers, the propeller pitch, P0.7 shall correspond to MCR in bollard condition. If not known, P0.7 shall have a value equal to 0.7*P0.7n, where P0.7n is the propeller pitch at MCR in free running condition.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <skos:altLabel>propellerPitchAtMcrFreeRunning</skos:altLabel>
