    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>For ships intended to operate in low air temperature, all rescue boats and lifeboats, whenever released for evacuation, shall: for distress alerting, carry one device for transmitting ship-to-shore alerts; in order to be located, carry one device for transmitting signals for location; and for on-scene communications, carry one device for transmitting and rec...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
