    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Category A and B ships that operate in areas of ice concentrations exceeding 1/10 for extended periods of time, may only discharge sewage using an approved sewage treatment plant certified by the Administration to meet the operational requirements in regulation 9.1.1 or 9.2.1 of MARPOL Annex IV. Such discharges shall be subject to approval by the Administrat...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
