    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-010 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.13 | 1.2.7; IMO-020 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.15 | 1.4.3; IMO-063 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.23 | 8.2.2; IMO-065 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.23-24 | 8.2.3.3; IMO-079 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.25 | 8.3.3.4; IMO-093 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.28 | 10.2.2.3; IMO-099 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.29 | 10.3.2.3</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Maximum expected time of rescue means the time adopted for the design of equipment and system that provide survival support. It shall never be less than 5 days.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
