    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-040 | TRAFICOM p.16 | 4.3.1</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>In addition, the following areas shall be strengthened: Fore foot: For ice class IA Super, the shell plating below the ice belt from the stem to a position five main frame spacings abaft of the point where the bow profile departs from the keel line shall be ice-strengthened in the same way as the bow region. Upper bow ice belt: For ice classes IA Super and I...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
