    <nltl:sourceReference>I2-047 | IACS_UR_I2 p.16 | I2.11.4</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Steel renewal for ice strengthened structures is required when the gauged thickness is less than tnet + 0.5 mm.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
