    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>(vi) Design ice forces calculated according to I2.3.2.1 (iv) are applicable for ships which are assigned the Polar Class PC6 or PC7 and have a bow form with vertical sides. This includes bows where the normal frame angles beta' at the considered sub-regions, as defined in I2.3.2.1 (i), are between 0 and 10 deg.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
