    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>For ships intended to operate in low air temperature, all other survival craft shall: in order to be located, carry one device for transmitting signals for location; and for on-scene communications, carry one device for transmitting and receiving on-scene communications.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
