    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-063 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.23 | 8.2.2</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>All life-saving appliances and associated equipment shall provide safe evacuation and be functional under the possible adverse environmental conditions during the maximum expected time of rescue.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
