    <nltl:namingBasis>Locked-workbook normalized regulatory term</nltl:namingBasis>
    <nltl:namingRule>N4 - preserve the source concept; normalize spelling to ASCII lowerCamelCase</nltl:namingRule>
    <nltl:unitDecisionStatus>Not a quantity property</nltl:unitDecisionStatus>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for iceAccumulationPreventionMeansPresent derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-083 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.27 | 9.3.2.1.3; IMO26-009 | IMO_AMEND_2026 p.3 | 9-1.3.2.1.3</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>For ships operating in areas and during periods where ice accretion is likely to occur, means to prevent the accumulation of ice on antennas required for navigation and communication shall be provided.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
