    <nltl:namingRule>N5 - component or subject first, followed by characteristic and qualifier/state; no unsupported external mapping</nltl:namingRule>
    <nltl:unitDecisionStatus>Recommended canonical QUDT unit selected by Stage 2 engineering normalization: Canonical benchmark torque/moment unit</nltl:unitDecisionStatus>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for bladeBendingMoment derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-105 | TRAFICOM p.47 | 6.6.2.1</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Blade stresses shall be calculated for the design loads in section 6.5.1. Finite element analysis shall be used for final approval of all propellers. The simplified root-area estimate is sigma_st = C_1*M_BL/(100*c*t^2) [MPa] (6.38).</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <skos:altLabel>M_BL</skos:altLabel>
    <nltl:sourceAlias>M_BL</nltl:sourceAlias>
