    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for iceLoadCycleCoefficientK2 derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-078 | TRAFICOM p.36 | 6.5.1.9; TRF-079 | TRAFICOM p.37 | 6.5.1.9</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The number of load cycles per propeller blade in the load spectrum shall be N_ice = k_1*k_2*k_3*N_class*n_n (6.14), where N_class is given in Table 6-6 and the propeller location factor k_1 is given in Table 6-7.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <skos:altLabel>k2</skos:altLabel>
    <nltl:sourceAlias>k2</nltl:sourceAlias>
    <nltl:sourceRequirementId>TRF-078</nltl:sourceRequirementId>
    <nltl:sourceRequirementId>TRF-079</nltl:sourceRequirementId>
    <nltl:unitSymbol>1</nltl:unitSymbol>
    <nltl:recommendedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/UNITLESS"/>
    <nltl:quantityKindLabel>DimensionlessRatio</nltl:quantityKindLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
