    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-022 | TRAFICOM p.10 | 3.2.2; TRF-061 | TRAFICOM p.25 | 4.7</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Coefficients f_1-f_4 and g_1-g_3 are given in Table 3-2. C_3 = 845 kg/(m^2*s^2), C_4 = 42 kg/(m^2*s^2), C_5 = 825 kg/s^2. psi = atan(tan(phi_2)/sin(alpha)). If the value of the term ((L*T)/B^2)^3 is less than 5, the value 5 shall be used; if the value is more than 20, the value 20 shall be used.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
