    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Polar Class ships are to have a minimum corrosion/abrasion addition of ts = 1.0 mm applied to all internal structures within the ice-strengthened hull areas, including plated members adjacent to the shell, as well as stiffener webs and flanges.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
