    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Recognizing the limitations arising from battery life, procedures shall be developed and implemented such that mandatory communication equipment for use in survival craft, including liferafts and rescue boats, are available for operation during the maximum expected time of rescue.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
