    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>For category A and B ships other than oil tankers constructed on or after 1 January 2017, all cargo tanks constructed and utilized to carry oil shall be separated from the outer shell by a distance of not less than 0.76 m.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
