    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Two-way on-scene and SAR coordination communication capability in ships shall include: voice and/or data communications with relevant rescue coordination centres; and equipment for voice communications with aircraft on 121.5 and 123.1 MHz.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
