    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-125 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.44 | 5.2.3</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Operation in polar waters shall be taken into account, as appropriate, in the Garbage Record Book, Garbage Management Plan and the placards as required by MARPOL Annex V.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
