    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>For ships exposed to ice accretion, means shall be provided to remove or prevent ice and snow accretion from escape routes, muster stations, embarkation areas, survival craft, their launching appliances and access to survival craft.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
