    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The master shall consider a route through polar waters, taking into account the following: the procedures required by the PWOM; any limitations of the hydrographic information and aids to navigation available; current information on the extent and type of ice and icebergs in the vicinity of the intended route; statistical information on ice and temperatures ...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
