    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-063 | TRAFICOM p.25 | 4.8</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>On twin and triple screw ships, the ice strengthening of the shell and framing shall be extended to the tank top 1.5 metres forward and aft of the side propellers.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
