    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The master shall consider a route through polar waters, taking into account the following: the procedures required by the safety management system on board; if no safety management system is implemented there shall be a documented procedure for operation in polar waters; any limitations of the hydrographic information and aids to navigation available; curren...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
