    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-017 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.14 | 1.3.6</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Polar Ship Certificate validity, survey dates and endorsements shall be harmonized with the relevant SOLAS certificates in accordance with the provisions of SOLAS regulation I/14. The certificate shall include a supplement, recording equipment required by the Code.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <skos:altLabel>polar_certificate_supplement_present</skos:altLabel>
