    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-020 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.15 | 1.4.3</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>For ships operating in low air temperature, survival systems and equipment shall be fully operational at the PST during the maximum expected rescue time.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
