    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for gnssCompassOrEquivalentCount derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-087 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.27 | 9.3.2.2.2; IMO26-013 | IMO_AMEND_2026 p.4 | 9-1.3.2.2.2</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Ships proceeding to latitudes over 80 degrees shall be fitted with at least one GNSS compass or equivalent, which shall be connected to the ship's main and emergency source of power.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
