    <nltl:sourceReference>IMO-103 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.31 | 12.3.2</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The Administration may allow the use of a person(s) other than the master, chief mate or officers of the navigational watch to satisfy the requirements for training, provided that: this person(s) shall be qualified and certified in accordance with regulation II/2 of the STCW Convention and section A-II/2 of the STCW Code, and meet the advance training requir...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
