    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for bladeOrderResonance derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-094 | TRAFICOM p.40 | 6.5.3.4</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>If there is a blade order resonance just above the MCR speed, calculations shall cover rotational speeds up to 105% of the MCR speed.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
